== The Rookie's Oath

#story(
  "Wave 0 — The Rookie's Oath",
  [
    The Primal Quarry is an old name — a terraced hunting ground carved into the cliffs above Kamura Village, where generations of hunters have been forged. Its lower terraces are gentle: forest paths, flooded hollows, a shrine wrapped in mist. Its deepest tiers are not gentle at all.

    The Guild keeps the quarry stocked with young hunters the way a forge keeps its fire fed, and every rookie who takes the oath begins the same way — with a weapon they barely understand, a palico that knows better than they do, and a promise: *learn, or be learned.*

    This wave is that promise. No exotic tools, no shortcuts — just you, your weapon, and the quarry teaching you how to hunt.
  ],
)

=== Wave 0 Goals

- Learn the full hunting loop: prepare, hunt, harvest, craft, repeat.
- Pick one weapon and learn its moveset properly.
- Clear the Kamura village story and enter High Rank through the Gathering Hub.
- Meet the Rampage — the quarry's first true trial — and survive it.
- Reach the point where Sunbreak's Master Rank begins (Part 4 continues from there).

#note[
  Wave 0 is deliberately slow. Nothing in this wave's modlist makes you stronger — the improvement has to come from you, and that is the point.
]
